  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Cooperation Facility - NDICI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The priority under this Action isto develop constructive relations, building reciprocal confidence on all (political and technical) issues of common interest and on Team Europe priorities. This aims at repositioning the Team Europe in the Zimbabwean landscape as a determinant actor, able to promote its values and interests and in particular those related with gender and green economy, fundamental objectives of the Team Europe Initiatives (TEI) in the country. The action goes beyond the priority areas of the MIP to extend to substantial communication activities, public diplomacy or cultural exchanges. The Action further supports the operationalisation of the Global Gateway Strategy, by supporting green and clean development investments and trade together, and in support of human development, and the highest standards of transparency and democratic values. This Action fits under the Support Measures foreseen under the Multiannual Indicative Program (MIP) 2021-2027 for Zimbabwe.</narrative>
  </description>
